- $s_i$: file_1_view_0, column supply_capacity, for each supplier_id $i$
- $c_{ij}$: file_2_view_0, row supplier_id $i$, column transportation_cost_to_$j$ (e.g., transportation_cost_to_C1 for $j$=C1)

